      "message": "It feels a little strange here to be implicitly depending on someone to have called `GetLayout()` with a matching attachment count prior to this. I\u0027m sure that it always works out that way at this point, but it would be nice to make it more explicit by either:\n 1) Adding comments to the function signature, probably in the .h explaining the relationship between the two methods.\n 2) Refactoring `GetLayout()` so that you can call it (or an internal variant) here and get the holder that you need regardless of whether it\u0027s been created previously or not.",
